su name fizzbuzz step to name num bucket fromindex num 0 toindex num 0 be ceremony def
exists su name handled ob num 0 be number ya
exists su name rem3 ob num 0 be number ya
exists su name rem5 ob num 0 be number ya
su name handled ob num 0 be number ya

ob this ti fromindex from num 3 to name rem3 be remains do
ob this ti fromindex from num 5 to name rem5 be remains do

ob name rem3 be equally from num 0 then ob num 1 to name handled be plus do
ob name rem5 be equally from num 0 then ob num 2 to name handled be plus do

ob name handled be equally from num 3 then ob text FizzBuzz be write do
ob name handled be equally from num 1 then ob text Fizz be write do
ob name handled be equally from num 2 then ob text Buzz be write do
ob name handled be equally from num 0 then ob this ti fromindex be write do
su name fizzbuzz step be ceremony prah

to name outside fromindex num 1 toindex num 101 be fizzbuzz step do
